  title: "T\xDAI D\u1ECACH XUNG"
  location: 
  description: "T\xFAi dung d\u1ECBch t\xEDch tr\u1EEF n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
    xung, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 h\u1EA5p th\u1EE5 nhanh khi s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng. H\u1ED3i
    mana ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c, gi\xFAp nh\xE2n v\u1EADt ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c d\xF9ng
    c\xE1c k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ti\xEAu hao n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng trong giao tranh."
